{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54838","headline":"兵要望江南 占鼠第十八（京本列第十○十首） 七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占鼠第十八（京本列第十○十首） 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"营寨内，白日鼠搬儿。\n不是火灾应大水，三日（辛本、川本、京本作「朝」）五（京本作「两」）日速迁移，不出祸相随。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54838.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54838","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}